OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fmerging to longer spells of rain,
OL,7,Fperhaps thundery, during Wednesday
OL,8,Fevening and spreading further north
OL,9,Fand east. Chance of hail and
OL,10,Flightning, mainly near coasts. Drier
OL,11,Flater.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FMostly dry start but
OL,14,Fcloudier with some showery rain
OL,15,Fspreading to western areas. Brighter
OL,16,Fwith some sunshine further east for a
OL,17,Ftime, especially towards London.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
