OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FTurning
OL,6,Fdrier and brighter during Friday once
OL,7,Fshowers fade. Saturday mostly sunny
OL,8,Fafter chilly start. Temperatures near
OL,9,For below normal. Mostly light winds.
OL,10,FCloudier with rain arriving through
OL,11,FSunday.
